1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:04,990
(Priya:)So did you get
to talk to Penny?

2
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:08,700
(Leonard:)Oh, yes.
Indeed, I did.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,400
(Priya:)And?

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,200
(Leonard:)She completely understood
everything I said. Case closed.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,840
(Priya:)Was she upset?

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,140
(Leonard:)Maybe, but that's
not my problem.

7
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:20,110
(Leonard:)She's not my girlfriend,
you are.

8
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:23,110
(Priya:)I hope you weren't
cruel to her.

9
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:27,520
(Leonard:)Is the autumn cruel
for letting the flowers die,

10
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,420
(Leonard:)or is that just nature's way?

11
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,550
(knocking)

12
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,390
SHELDON: Leonard?
(knocking) Leonard?

13
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:36,520
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

14
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,030
What?!

15
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:40,760
(Sheldon:)I think I figured out
Wolowitz's magic trick,

16
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:43,930
(Sheldon:)and I need you
to pick a card.

17
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:48,470
(Leonard:)I am not opening
that door, Sheldon!

18
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,800
(Sheldon:)As you wish.

19
00:00:54,910 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)Pick a card, put it back,
and prepare to be amazed.

